  "question": {
    "text": "Sulphurous acid <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Ka</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Ka</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> The <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>588</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is____________&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo></math>Round off to the Nearest Integer<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>)</mo></math>.",
    "image": null
