  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo></math>Dibasic acid<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>]</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>588</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi></math> of solution is&nbsp;due to First dissociation only since <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>Ka</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> First dissociation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8652;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#8853;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>HSO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>ka</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>Ka</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#8853;</mo></msup></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msubsup><mi>HSO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></mfenced></mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>588</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>588</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>100</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#8853;</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>09186</mn></math></p><p>Therefore <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi></math> of sol. is :</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#8853;</mo></msup></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>pH</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>09186</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>036</mn><mo>&#8771;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
